From 3b8aa37ffe4c323282f78dfab097120fea88c835 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:54:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): scope mark credit to the part(s) the operation
 marks

Scope `stock_sim::credit_marks` via `Mark::target` so a part-source
Engrave or Trace credits only its own source entities' facets (and reads
those facets' own tops and undersides), while a stock-source mark keeps
`target: None` and credits every part in the setup.

Fixes #1627
